Subject: [PATCH] Finish fresh token authority, share loaders and retry POM handover
Base: ca8a66b2708ddab3022c2041e1beccf7c02bcaac

WHY: Register TAR before transferring token CCIP/default administration to the DAO.
Gate script-3 revocation on fresh token/TAR readiness and guard BurnMint setters by
DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE before broadcasting. Custom setters have explicit host handovers.
Share config loading with fork rehearsals and skip completed POM role transfers.
Only deployment scripts are patched; tests/docs live in the host repository.
PoolOperationManager source and deployed bytecode are unchanged.

